OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 9 JAN
OL,4,G1200FLauren Laverne
OL,5,     GLauren is joined by Henry Rollins
OL,6,     Gfor a very special co-host to
OL,7,     Gdissect David Bowie's prolific
OL,8,     Gcareer through his notable
OL,9,     Gcollaborations.
OL,10,G1300FCraig Charles
OL,11,     GCraig celebrates the musical
OL,12,     Gevolution and lasting legacy of
OL,13,     GDavid Bowie, and hears from Brett
OL,14,     GAnderson and Tilda Swinton about
OL,15,     Gwhat Bowie meant to them.
OL,16,G1500FCraig Charles
OL,17,     GCraig Charles speaks to Brett
OL,18,     GAnderson about Bowie's musical
OL,19,     Goutput in the seventies, with a
OL,20,     Gfocus on 'Hunky Dory', which came
OL,21,     Gout in 1971.
